# Body/Organs/Neocyte/base.yml
ent-OrganNeocyteBrain = cybernetic brain
ent-OrganNeocyteBrain-desc = The source of incredible, unending intelligence. 01201020 02102111 01201210 02121012 20121210
ent-OrganNeocyteEyes = cybernetic eyes
ent-OrganNeocyteEyes-desc = It's still focusing on you.. Creepy.
ent-OrganNeocyteTongue = cybernetic tongue
ent-OrganNeocyteTongue-desc = A completely glowing organ commonly used for lying or self-expression. Sometimes both.
ent-OrganNeocyteTongueForked = forked cybernetic tongue
ent-OrganNeocyteTongueForked-desc = A completely glowing organ commonly used for lying or self-expression. Sometimes both. Now split in two.
ent-OrganNeocyteEars = cybernetic ears
ent-OrganNeocyteEars-desc = Process audio at a higher quality than most humanoids, allowing for greater appreciation of techno music
ent-OrganNeocyteLungs = cybernetic lungs
ent-OrganNeocyteLungs-desc = Filters oxygen from an atmosphere, which is then sent into the bloodstream to be used as an electron carrier. Entirely cybernetic in nature, working in tandem with the visor's filtration system.
ent-OrganNeocyteHeart = cybernetic heart
ent-OrganNeocyteHeart-desc = Doesn't actually need to beat, simply mimics the movement to provide comfort for the user.
ent-OrganNeocyteStomach = biological reactor
ent-OrganNeocyteStomach-desc = Some call it over-engineered, but it's vital to the function of a neocyte. Turns organic matter into organic and electrical energy to power the neocyte's cybernetics and flesh.
ent-OrganNeocyteLiver = cybernetic liver
ent-OrganNeocyteLiver-desc = Pairing suggestion, a side of fermented RAM sticks and a nice CPU.
ent-OrganNeocyteKidneys = cybernetic kidneys
ent-OrganNeocyteKidneys-desc = Pumps toxins out of the bloodstream and serves as a minor biological battery for electrical components
